            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dinh Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Explore02738917514\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nHanh\nDec 2023 • Business\nWe booked lunch at Pho Dinh , 69 Nam Ky Khoi Nghia for appx 20 people. We have transfered cash deposit, reminded that lunch should be ready at 12pm. However, bad experiences ever i faced, until 1pm foods not fully ready, they delivered meet to table without rice and rice had delivered after 30 minutes, set menu soup, hotpot... nearly 1pm while we ordered set menu lunchs and deposited 2 days ago. Such loose face for me at it was my lunch birthday, and such terrible experiences with such kind of rest at a nice place or district 1. Pay full bill, people came to have lunch but feel hungry and tired, and even though i further ordered Pizza to office to recover but i still felt thus was my bad time ever just because an ashame lunch at this place !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 2, 2024",
