            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dinh Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tonie B\nCape Town, South Africa137 contributions\n0\nInteresting lunch\nNov 2019\nBy chance found this place while walking around Saigon. They have a very interesting menu from basic to very exclusive (and expensive) dishes on offer. We opted for the prime rib which came thinly sliced which you then cook on a grid over a charcoal fire on your table. The meat was tender and the served with a variety of side dishes and a salad. Ice cold beer and a very reasonable price made for a very good lunch experience.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 30, 2019",
