            "review_text": "Juyeona JerryJoo\nBucharest, Romania5 contributions\n1\nTop BBQ restaurant in HCMC\nOct 2018 • Friends\nI have to say, Pho Dinh is one of the best BBQ restaurants chain in HCMC. My friend moved from her hometown to HCMC a year ago, and last month when I came here for my business trip, she take me to Pho Dinh to eat dinner with her. This restaurant is not a buffet-style restaurant but an à la carte, so the price is quite more expensive than others. But of course, you get what you paid for and Pho Dinh's quality deserve it. I'm totally sure that I will be back next time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 12, 2018",
