            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dinh Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Bae B\n622 contributions\n0\nGood food, but bad service.\nJun 2017 • Couples\nPricy upscale restaurant, though the food was very good. For the price, service was pretty bad though. Waiting staff took very long to respond to calls, and frequently forgot orders. I understand it was a busy night, but it was beyond acceptable. Most of the time, we waited at least 10 minutes after calling a water/waitress, and had to call again for one to come. And many times they forgot to bring us what we asked for. If you like the food there, go to the one on Tran Quoc Thao instead, much better service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 1, 2018",
